{"id":1873,"date":"2026-08-25T16:51:55","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T16:51:55","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1873"},"modified":"2026-08-25T17:34:09","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:34:09","slug":"spell-check","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/accessibility\/spell-check\/","title":{"rendered":"Spell Check"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Spell Check<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1889\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheckMain.webp\" alt=\"Spell Check\" width=\"121\" height=\"125\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheckMain.webp 919w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheckMain-289x300.webp 289w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheckMain-768x798.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 121px) 100vw, 121px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher provides desktop-grade spell check suggestions built directly into the right-click context menu, powered by the <strong>LanguageTool API<\/strong>. Corrections are applied instantly with full undo support, so fixing a misspelling is always safe and reversible.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Using Spell Check<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1881\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheck.webp\" alt=\"Using Spell Check\" width=\"121\" height=\"142\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheck.webp 384w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SpellCheck-255x300.webp 255w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 121px) 100vw, 121px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click on any word underlined with the browser&#8217;s red squiggly spell-check indicator.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A <strong>\u201cChecking spelling\u2026\u201d<\/strong> spinner appears briefly at the top of the context menu while the LanguageTool API fetches corrections.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1877\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-175447.png\" alt=\"Spell Check Right click context menu\" width=\"512\" height=\"215\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-175447.png 787w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-175447-300x126.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-175447-768x323.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Up to three top spelling suggestions appear in the menu, each marked with a magic wand icon.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click any suggestion to instantly replace the misspelled word, preserving your existing formatting and adding the correction to the undo history.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Bulletproof Word Detection<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To reliably identify exactly which word you right-clicked, Open Publisher uses a three-tier detection approach:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1883\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BulletproofWordDetection.webp\" alt=\"Bulletproof Word Detection\" width=\"121\" height=\"140\" \/><\/h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Tier 1 &#8211;<\/strong> Checks whether you explicitly highlighted the word before right-clicking.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Tier 2 &#8211;<\/strong> Uses the X\/Y pixel coordinates of your click to locate the nearest text node on the page.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Tier 3 &#8211;<\/strong> Falls back to the current cursor (caret) position if the click did not land directly on the text.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">This layered approach ensures the correct word is always identified and corrected, regardless of how precisely you clicked.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Spell Check Open Publisher provides desktop-grade spell check suggestions built directly into the right-click context menu, powered by the LanguageTool API. Corrections are applied instantly with full undo support, so fixing a misspelling is always safe and reversible. Using Spell Check Right-click on any word underlined with the browser&#8217;s red squiggly spell-check indicator. A \u201cChecking [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1889,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[23],"class_list":["post-1873","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-accessibility"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1873","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v